## 📄 CV / Resume

### `Wamiq_Ajmal_CV.pdf`

This is the professional CV linked from the portfolio website.

The main portfolio uses the following path:

```text
assets/Wamiq_Ajmal_CV.pdf
```

This file can be opened directly from the portfolio through the **Download CV** button.

