## 🖼️ Profile Image

### `profile.jpg`

This image is used as the profile picture in the portfolio interface.

The website references it as:

```text
profile.jpg
```

The current portfolio keeps the primary profile image in the repository root. The copy inside `assets/` can be retained as an additional asset.

