## 🧊 3D Models

### `3D_Models/`

This folder is intended for engineering design files and 3D modeling resources.

Possible contents include:

- SolidWorks models
- CAD assemblies
- STEP files
- STL files
- Engineering model references
- Project-related CAD documentation

Each model should be named clearly so it can be identified easily.

Example:

```text
3D_Models/
├── portable_metal_cutting_machine/
├── component_models/
└── README.md
```

---

## 🏆 Certifications

### `certifications/`

This folder is intended for professional and academic certificates.

Possible files include:

- Training certificates
- Internship certificates
- Course certificates
- Technical certifications
- Workshop certificates
- Academic certificates

Recommended naming format:

```text
Organization_Certificate_Name_Year.pdf
```

Example:

```text
PCSIR_Industrial_Training_2026.pdf
```

---

## 📸 Screenshots

### `screenshots/`

This folder is used for screenshots of the portfolio website that can be displayed in the main GitHub `README.md`.

Recommended screenshots:

```text
screenshots/
├── home.png
├── experience.png
├── projects.png
├── skills.png
└── contact.png
```

These images are for documentation and presentation only and do not affect the operation of the portfolio website.

