## 📌 Maintenance Notes

Keep the existing filenames and folder locations unchanged when possible because the portfolio references specific asset paths.

For example:

```text
assets/Wamiq_Ajmal_CV.pdf
```

Changing the filename or moving the CV without updating `index.html` can break the CV link.

Similarly, keep project and certification files inside their respective folders to maintain a clean repository structure.

